    "content": {
        "sentences": [
            [
                "Now let's walk up the stairs.",
                "现在让我们走上楼梯。"
            ],
            [
                "There are three bedrooms and two bathrooms on the first floor.",
                "一楼有三间卧室和两间浴室。"
            ],
            [
                "The largest room is the master bedroom.",
                "最大的房间是主卧室。"
            ],
            [
                "The colours of the wooden furniture and the curtains are matched.",
                "木质家具和窗帘的颜色很搭配。"
            ],
            [
                "My wife has lots of clothes, so I made her a walk-in closet.",
                "我的妻子有很多衣服，所以我为她做了一个步入式衣橱。"
            ],
            [
                "Next is James' bedroom.",
                "接下来是詹姆斯的卧室。"
            ],
            [
                "There's a single bed, a cabinet, a shelf, a desk and an armchair in his room.",
                "他的房间里有一张单人床、一个储物柜、一个架子、一张书桌和一把扶手椅。"
            ],
            [
                "He wants to keep it simple.",
                "他想保持简单。"
            ],
            [
                "Mia lives in the opposite room.",
                "米娅住在对面的房间。"
            ],
            [
                "Sometimes her friends stay overnight and sleep in her room.",
                "有时她的朋友会过夜并睡在她的房间里。"
            ],
            [
                "Your room is on the second floor.",
                "你的房间在二楼。"
            ],
            [
                "We painted your walls with a bright colour.",
                "我们用明亮的颜色粉刷了你的墙壁。"
            ],
            [
                "Have you noticed flowers beside the lamp and the alarm clock?",
                "你注意到台灯和闹钟旁边的花了吗？"
            ],
            [
                "Mia picked them from the garden.",
                "米娅从花园里摘的这些花。"
            ],
            [
                "We hope you like them.",
                "我们希望你喜欢它们。"
            ],
            [
                "We got new pillows and bed sheets for you.",
                "我们为你准备了新枕头和新床单。"
            ],
            [
                "If you feel cold at night, you can find a blanket in the wardrobe.",
                "如果你晚上感到冷，可以在衣柜里找到毛毯。"
            ],
            [
                "The heating system is powered by electricity, and you can adjust the temperature on your own.",
                "供暖系统是电力驱动的，你可以自己调节温度。"
            ],
            [
                "The toilet is on the right side.",
                "洗手间在右边。"
            ],
            [
                "You can take a shower, but if you want to use the bathtub, you need to go downstairs.",
                "你可以淋浴，但如果想使用浴缸，你需要下楼。"
            ],
            [
                "We have also prepared shampoo and towels.",
                "我们还准备了洗发水和毛巾。"
            ],
            [
                "By the way, Luna will help you tidy up your room and your toilet every week.",
                "顺便说一下，露娜每周会帮你收拾房间和洗手间。"
            ],
            [
                "Please don't make these places too dirty.",
                "请不要把这些地方弄得太脏。"
            ],
            [
                "It's five o'clock now and I'm afraid that I have to leave for a while.",
                "现在五点钟了，恐怕我得离开一会儿。"
            ],
            [
                "Here is your key.",
                "这是你的钥匙。"
            ],
            [
                "We'll have dinner in one and a half hours.",
                "我们一个半小时后吃晚饭。"
            ]
        ]
    },
